#: 0b588ad23b19486a8adef3122e49d5ee
msgid "基于 E(3) 等变 Transformer 的 HamGNN 模型。"
msgstr "A HamGNN model based on the E(3) equivariant Transformer."

#: e5caa8af4b90403185eff79e111e11d8
msgid ""
"该模型采用等变自注意力机制来捕捉原子间的相互作用，替代了传统的卷积操作。 它允许模型在更新节点特征时，动态地权衡来自不同邻居的信息。 "
"模型的整体结构与 `HamGNNConvE3` 相似，但核心交互层换成了 `AttentionBlockE3`。"
msgstr ""
"This model uses an equivariant self-attention mechanism to capture "
"interactions between atoms, replacing traditional convolution operations. It "
"allows the model to dynamically weigh information from different neighbors "
"when updating node features. The overall architecture is similar to "
"`HamGNNConvE3`, but the core interaction layer is replaced with "
"`AttentionBlockE3`."

#: a53eeca161a047e0a5ee18384cc26e36
msgid "等变 Transformer 层的数量。"
msgstr "The number of equivariant Transformer layers."

#: 907dfcfb84ae4804a8051f2f6b0aea3f
msgid "自注意力机制中的头数。"
msgstr "The number of heads in the self-attention mechanism."

#: 5fc0145ddbc54c4bbc3881a00621e3ff
msgid "等变 Transformer 层列表。"
msgstr "List of equivariant Transformer layers."

#: aea9c761c1a24fb9b1ad18329addec8f
msgid "相关性乘积层列表。"
msgstr "List of correlation product layers."

#: c37a459c7a394ebf85aebf903602c52b
msgid "基类：:py:class:`object`"
msgstr "Bases: :py:class:`object`"

#: 7efc650f72df44d6a52ea91586c9db06
msgid ""
"一个独立的、非JIT兼容的模块，负责从晶体结构数据中生成K点路径。 "
"它将所有与pymatgen和kpoints_generator相关的逻辑与核心计算模型分离。"
msgstr ""
"An independent, non-JIT-compatible module responsible for generating k-point "
"paths from crystal structure data. It separates all logic related to "
"pymatgen and kpoints_generator from the core computational model."

#: 1c206389a8f44459b80f477512f898b4 7ad937bfb3d74149bafdafdc0199715c
msgid "基类：:py:class:`~torch.nn.modules.module.Module`"
msgstr "Bases: :py:class:`~torch.nn.modules.module.Module`"

#: 5ad5662c9bf34a12809b3803608891cb
msgid "原HamGNNPlusPlusOut 的输出核心，包含Script兼容的计算逻辑。"
msgstr ""
"The output core of the original HamGNNPlusPlusOut, containing Script-"
"compatible computation logic."

#: 6e1dee76df9e4a7b9181d09ec38afd36
msgid ""
"这个模块接收图神经网络编码的等变特征，并利用这些特征作为系数， 通过 Clebsch-Gordan 张量积将它们组合成完整的哈密顿量 (H) "
"和重叠矩阵 (S)。 它能够处理多种 DFT 软件（如 OpenMX, SIESTA, ABACUS）的基组，支持自旋轨道耦合（SOC）、 "
"自旋约束计算，并能最终求解能带结构。"
msgstr ""
"This module receives equivariant features encoded by the graph neural "
"network and uses them as coefficients to form the complete Hamiltonian (H) "
"and overlap matrix (S) through Clebsch-Gordan tensor products. It can handle "
"basis sets from various DFT software (like OpenMX, SIESTA, ABACUS), supports "
"spin-orbit coupling (SOC), spin-constrained calculations, and can ultimately "
"solve for the band structure."

#: 383bc77948a2407a9b66e9a24ed90f55
msgid "预设的最大原子轨道数。"
msgstr "Preset maximum number of atomic orbitals."

#: 63caf19410c64defae3062ecdf6c229d
msgid "使用的 DFT 基组类型 (例如 'openmx')。"
msgstr "The type of DFT basis set used (e.g., 'openmx')."

#: 016518b8549740f3bb59ff94bcb5a54a
msgid "str"
msgstr "str"

#: 5497df86756549c5b73b61c332729911
msgid "如果为 True，则只计算哈密顿量，不计算重叠矩阵。"
msgstr "If True, only the Hamiltonian is computed, not the overlap matrix."

#: 1f21748ea33b43168f43413f5aa415f1 259dfe2376d84861b0afba689e885396
#: bba1ae906c3a4fa980c0d539a30fe405
msgid "bool"
msgstr "bool"

#: 590bf5aefe3247688d3f6171c3a18598
msgid "是否启用自旋轨道耦合计算。"
msgstr "Whether to enable spin-orbit coupling calculations."

#: 35b5cd30966346959c2142301d5b3864
msgid "是否进行自旋约束计算。"
msgstr "Whether to perform spin-constrained calculations."

#: ece28a8efd444dd3906ebd8de4eb0604
msgid "哈密顿量/重叠矩阵块的不可约表示。"
msgstr "Irreducible representations (irreps) for the Hamiltonian/overlap matrix blocks."

#: a0455dd19b3b4da6bdb5ee7f6aa287c8
msgid "用于从节点特征预测 onsite 哈密顿量块的网络。"
msgstr "Network for predicting onsite Hamiltonian blocks from node features."

#: b2dbc8283fdf47eaa133405a5da2cdb4
msgid "用于从边特征预测 offsite 哈密顿量块的网络。"
msgstr "Network for predicting offsite Hamiltonian blocks from edge features."

#: b3f6c7abb5794f32916e7fda4025ed33
msgid "用于计算 Clebsch-Gordan 系数的工具。"
msgstr "Tool for calculating Clebsch-Gordan coefficients."

#: e1824fcb93b84ef4a0697b38be5c7020
msgid "ClebschGordanCoefficients"
msgstr "ClebschGordanCoefficients"

#: 91bd1b16b7ca4655bddb3b799aed71cb
msgid "将一系列球谐系数（等变特征）通过 Clebsch-Gordan 积合并成矩阵块。"
msgstr ""
"Combines a series of spherical harmonic coefficients (equivariant features) "
"into matrix blocks via Clebsch-Gordan products."

#: 504a464ccce946b28151ea2469e12f8c
msgid "这是模型的核心步骤之一，它将神经网络预测的抽象特征（`sph_split`） 转换为物理上可解释的哈密顿量或重叠矩阵的组成部分。"
msgstr ""
"This is one of the core steps of the model, converting abstract features "
"(`sph_split`) predicted by the neural network into physically interpretable "
"components of the Hamiltonian or overlap matrix."

#: e260a9e6716644018e80d3a793a8365e
msgid "一个张量列表，每个张量对应 `self.ham_irreps` 中的一个不可约表示的系数。 形状为 `(N_batch, 2L+1)`。"
msgstr ""
"A list of tensors, where each tensor corresponds to the coefficients of an "
"irreducible representation in `self.ham_irreps`. The shape is `(N_batch, "
"2L+1)`."

#: c2251fb3c27e4fd8afc079315b5c1595
msgid "合并后的矩阵块，形状为 `(N_batch, nao_max * nao_max)`。"
msgstr "The combined matrix block, with a shape of `(N_batch, nao_max * nao_max)`."

#: 5a17fcd95cd9484690ad113afced0b24
msgid "将球谐系数合并为二阶张量（3x3矩阵），用于 SOC 计算中的交换项 J。"
msgstr ""
"Combines spherical harmonic coefficients into a second-order tensor (3x3 "
"matrix) for the exchange term J in SOC calculations."

#: 3795804e276c439ba34a8b11a43e9139
msgid "对应 `self.J_irreps` 的球谐系数列表。"
msgstr "List of spherical harmonic coefficients corresponding to `self.J_irreps`."

#: 80f746b4891e4fcd934449455bc10b82
msgid "形状为 `(N_batch, N_blocks, 3, 3)` 的张量。"
msgstr "A tensor with the shape `(N_batch, N_blocks, 3, 3)`."

#: 39645e1e58ac4a889e98324de3e7ce44
msgid "将零阶（标量）球谐系数合并为矩阵。"
msgstr "Combines zeroth-order (scalar) spherical harmonic coefficients into a matrix."

#: 2e174dd891e340d8af9e58377a100d2c
msgid "这用于非 SOC 情况下的交换项 J，其中 J 是一个标量。"
msgstr "This is used for the exchange term J in non-SOC cases, where J is a scalar."

#: 41b1caec429d45d6a0cdcc271df2a380
msgid "对应零阶 Irreps 的系数列表。"
msgstr "List of coefficients corresponding to the zeroth-order Irreps."

#: 0adab5e0569c4749af9865065ad9c423
msgid "形状为 `(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max)` 的矩阵。"
msgstr "A matrix with the shape `(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max)`."

#: 0e994058140c4ea5a393a5436f8c9f31
msgid "将拉格朗日乘子（交换场）合并成完整的交换相互作用矩阵 J。"
msgstr ""
"Combines Lagrange multipliers (exchange field) into the complete exchange "
"interaction matrix J."

#: 7640280f66564af4806be7b83a29e3a4
msgid "神经网络预测的交换场系数。"
msgstr "Exchange field coefficients predicted by the neural network."

#: af95612ba9f545639e7d02d942634921
msgid ""
"交换相互作用矩阵 J。 如果 `soc_switch` 为 True, 形状为 `(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max, 3, "
"3)`。 否则，形状为 `(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max)`。"
msgstr ""
"The exchange interaction matrix J. If `soc_switch` is True, the shape is "
"`(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max, 3, 3)`. Otherwise, the shape is `(N_batch, "
"nao_max, nao_max)`."

#: e4f5ad0f9a8f47c280f80828a16f93c2
msgid "将拉格朗日乘子合并成四阶相互作用矩阵 K。"
msgstr "Combines Lagrange multipliers into the fourth-order interaction matrix K."

#: 4ad272d6f7254442ac1c08705a77ad3f
msgid "神经网络预测的四阶项系数。"
msgstr "Fourth-order term coefficients predicted by the neural network."

#: 7e0646eb51a24f869d0cd5a03f2f371f
msgid "四阶相互作用矩阵 K，形状 `(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max)`。"
msgstr ""
"The fourth-order interaction matrix K, with a shape of `(N_batch, nao_max, "
"nao_max)`."

#: 7fd72bd8e0e14afb9a4ff532d9a9b363
msgid "根据 DFT 软件（如 openmx, siesta）的约定，调整输出矩阵元素的顺序。 这确保了生成的哈密顿量与目标软件的原子轨道顺序相匹配。"
msgstr ""
"Adjusts the order of the output matrix elements according to the conventions "
"of the DFT software (e.g., openmx, siesta). This ensures that the generated "
"Hamiltonian matches the atomic orbital order of the target software."

#: aa6279092c834604914d62be093334b4
msgid "原始哈密顿量矩阵。"
msgstr "The original Hamiltonian matrix."

#: e7086f38b9534875835f99bafa258cda
msgid "索引调整后的哈密顿量。"
msgstr "The Hamiltonian after index adjustment."

#: 034b0ed345314c5e8fb26c8d43563ca3
msgid "将 onsite 和 offsite 矩阵块组装成完整的分子哈密顿量。 这个函数目前似乎没有被使用。"
msgstr ""
"Assembles onsite and offsite matrix blocks into the complete molecular "
"Hamiltonian. This function does not seem to be currently in use."

#: 9efb1a1d97b7498294d7bd24ae035a6d
msgid "输入的图数据。"
msgstr "Input graph data."

#: f732d05cb0f64b9a9aa6311a0e1f0df2
msgid "Onsite 哈密顿量块。"
msgstr "Onsite Hamiltonian blocks."

#: 7b6a41c45f294d10b24b82cde2dac2cd
msgid "Offsite 哈密顿量块。"
msgstr "Offsite Hamiltonian blocks."

#: ef7a48c8d0c54e138bfe240733638b75
msgid "组装后的完整哈密顿量。"
msgstr "The assembled complete Hamiltonian."

#: af11777ecc61476cbc9e563cb0a70c27
msgid "将批处理中的 onsite 和 offsite 矩阵块按顺序拼接起来。"
msgstr "Concatenates the onsite and offsite matrix blocks from the batch in sequence."

#: 3745154f8f7f4078abedf0826d22014d fce69a661f5a449196bb1dae36b951d6
msgid "每个晶胞中的节点数。"
msgstr "Number of nodes in each unit cell."

#: 1f6e889764d945fb8747f6a9a5f35d29 2e841ea274024c389ec46570ad7c948d
#: 6e60059c6869483abc525e0c4bb95e36 bb1fd6432d94476f9ccf33c6e272eaa6
msgid "边索引张量。"
msgstr "Edge index tensor."

#: 378bf7528f10451fb7b8ab2eadb26894 8a558914cf95446b95e00ef57b7d27f1
msgid "批次信息。"
msgstr "Batch information."

#: 53522bf3f5494a5d904eb7a044f92f37 5a153679f4704b798a7ac899628083eb
msgid "Onsite 矩阵块。"
msgstr "Onsite matrix blocks."

#: 4684a9d5d0874e758c06bfe47683858f 475056441fcc4eeeaafe7881cd0b9152
msgid "Offsite 矩阵块。"
msgstr "Offsite matrix blocks."

#: 8b909db1c9e54afa94fb55e0ec84fb40
msgid "拼接后的矩阵块。"
msgstr "Concatenated matrix blocks."

#: a25153f60dec4466a52e56355d022b9a
msgid "对称化 Onsite 矩阵块。"
msgstr "Symmetrize onsite matrix blocks."

#: ff4951315240407c99224619452d4900
msgid "对称化方式，'+' 表示 (A + A.T)/2 (厄米)，'-' 表示 (A - A.T)/2 (反厄米)。"
msgstr ""
"Symmetrization method, '+' for (A + A.T)/2 (Hermitian), '-' for (A - A.T)/2 "
"(anti-Hermitian)."

#: 581591a185414b82957ece43ed52cce6 8aa2ca895dcf4f9d83a5da952c8b17c7
msgid "对称化后的矩阵。"
msgstr "Symmetrized matrix."

#: 8e01fcb2cc5a4f6899784200da18c4e7
msgid "对称化 Offsite 矩阵块。 利用 `inv_edge_idx` (逆向边的索引) 来确保 H_ij = H_ji.T。"
msgstr ""
"Symmetrize offsite matrix blocks. Uses `inv_edge_idx` (inverse edge index) "
"to ensure H_ij = H_ji.T."

#: d6e22a70afaa469ba7318211608c11aa
msgid "逆向边的索引。"
msgstr "Index of inverse edges."

#: 6cdc4535f5e84cb9afe84c20ccd51f46
msgid "对称化方式，'+' 或 '-'。"
msgstr "Symmetrization method, '+' or '-'."

#: 46a4a123cf4f420b90f056b8dc4b869f
msgid "对称化包含 SOC 的 Onsite 矩阵块 (尺寸为 2*nao_max)。"
msgstr "Symmetrize onsite matrix blocks including SOC (size 2*nao_max)."

#: 9d8d0df0b080429e97b7ba921ee6afe5
msgid "对称化包含 SOC 的 Offsite 矩阵块 (尺寸为 2*nao_max)。"
msgstr "Symmetrize offsite matrix blocks including SOC (size 2*nao_max)."

#: 0b07eb9098af44e29ab48284b457f6e2
msgid "计算能带结构（调试版本）。"
msgstr "Calculate band structure (debug version)."

#: cc9a9b5e821c4c83b46358860c6a458f
msgid ""
"通过傅里叶变换将实空间的哈密顿量 H(R) 和重叠矩阵 S(R) 转换为 倒易空间的 H(k) 和 S(k)，然后求解广义本征值问题 `H(k)c"
" = ES(k)c` 来得到能带。"
msgstr ""
"Transforms the real-space Hamiltonian H(R) and overlap matrix S(R) to "
"reciprocal-space H(k) and S(k) via Fourier transform, then solves the "
"generalized eigenvalue problem `H(k)c = ES(k)c` to obtain the band structure."

#: c0c4e5ae537f4c42af5cc3a8718216bd
msgid "预测的 onsite 哈密顿量。"
msgstr "Predicted onsite Hamiltonian."

#: 0b35085743f4484a8297c930a2aaed61
msgid "预测的 offsite 哈密顿量。"
msgstr "Predicted offsite Hamiltonian."

#: d0e0638e7a1a4091a4f163d0d5220365
msgid "预测的 onsite 重叠矩阵。"
msgstr "Predicted onsite overlap matrix."

#: 6a04378e339d413e9ae824cddb8588e8
msgid "预测的 offsite 重叠矩阵。"
msgstr "Predicted offsite overlap matrix."

#: bb2cc1ee48b349f9a449e5a4d0e49ca7
msgid "输入数据。"
msgstr "Input data."

#: 13f8166e30494aac9662b318a293d27c
msgid "是否返回倒易空间矩阵。"
msgstr "Whether to return reciprocal space matrices."

#: 1c9e25af5b9a4ac6bda2f381e32d0303
msgid "包含能带能量、波函数、带隙等信息的元组。"
msgstr "A tuple containing band energies, wavefunctions, band gap, etc."

#: 98678d1cce3e4068a490c7a456e0f253
msgid "计算能带结构（非调试的正式版本）。"
msgstr "Calculate band structure (official, non-debug version)."

#: e3e79c46d98f4287ba76d6cedd29a7fd
msgid ""
"此函数通过给定的 onsite 和 offsite 矩阵块，为一批晶体构建 k 点依赖的哈密顿量 "
"和重叠矩阵，然后通过求解广义本征值问题来计算能带结构。 该过程与 `cal_band_energy_debug` "
"类似，但流程更精简，不涉及对预计算 `Son`, `Soff` 的依赖。"
msgstr ""
"This function constructs k-point dependent Hamiltonians and overlap matrices "
"for a batch of crystals from given onsite and offsite matrix blocks, then "
"calculates the band structure by solving the generalized eigenvalue problem. "
"The process is similar to `cal_band_energy_debug` but more streamlined, "
"without dependency on pre-calculated `Son` and `Soff`."

#: 5242b3f8d3544f859fbb8a8676a929fa 79a5104a249843e6a7a0eb594d9c815b
msgid "当前实现主要针对 `openmx` 类型的哈密顿量。"
msgstr "The current implementation primarily targets `openmx` type Hamiltonians."

#: 5481f5758ad04ec1917561b337209996
msgid "批处理中所有原子/轨道的 Onsite 矩阵块，形状通常为 `(N_nodes, nao_max*nao_max)`。"
msgstr ""
"Onsite matrix blocks for all atoms/orbitals in the batch, typically with "
"shape `(N_nodes, nao_max*nao_max)`."

#: a5f9cba8e908491db2f1d31b0d426bd8
msgid "批处理中所有边的 Offsite 矩阵块，形状通常为 `(N_edges, nao_max*nao_max)`。"
msgstr ""
"Offsite matrix blocks for all edges in the batch, typically with shape "
"`(N_edges, nao_max*nao_max)`."

#: 073082c83d61496f828e02d2485786bc e0f2fa32c95d4825b5a51c84e2fc7aa4
msgid "边的索引张量，形状为 (2, num_edges)。"
msgstr "Edge index tensor, with shape (2, num_edges)."

#: 5ff8fc2989414238bd256bc2e714139c
msgid "晶胞参数张量，形状为 (N_batch, 3, 3)。"
msgstr "Lattice parameter tensor, with shape (N_batch, 3, 3)."

#: 27a5197464154d16b6abdd051c69b1f9 291ed50af7694ec0a897cf50e249b3b9
#: 2ed13a2bbb86470987a98667a07648d0 8db3d3b1af354eed8f86f1a973cb86c8
#: a2391e9f38ee4f8895b5866a1d250f4b f767433f7d8d41cebd4c62c25be5b91f
msgid "原子序数张量。"
msgstr "Atomic number tensor."

#: 860574a9ffd041fb82f32e42c8178803
msgid "每个图中的节点数。"
msgstr "Number of nodes in each graph."

#: 61fee6eebbed4b46b3d4df50f2939a16
msgid "批次索引张量。"
msgstr "Batch index tensor."

#: 610a20e0d37e4942852a92fda82946e6
msgid "Onsite 重叠矩阵块。"
msgstr "Onsite overlap matrix blocks."

#: 4746b94363f744479e314c0c505eae5a
msgid "Offsite 重叠矩阵块。"
msgstr "Offsite overlap matrix blocks."

#: 00c0e41fa35b4e63b2aea10c20803cf4
msgid "邻居晶胞偏移张量。"
msgstr "Neighboring unit cell shift tensor."

#: 07d48877da974a0c92c371ac90563d5a
msgid "k点向量张量。"
msgstr "k-point vector tensor."

#: 08c22b0df4004857a6f5edfddeb78d5e
msgid "Onsite 重叠矩阵的导数，默认为 None。"
msgstr "Derivative of the onsite overlap matrix, defaults to None."

#: 79dd9cc3e3044ad5ae2378a5721a0998
msgid "Offsite 重叠矩阵的导数，默认为 None。"
msgstr "Derivative of the offsite overlap matrix, defaults to None."

#: 53d9dbbd8a53420bb5e467177dc92ac9
msgid "如果为 True，则额外返回倒易空间中的 哈密顿量 `HK`、重叠矩阵 `SK`、`SK`的导数`dSK` 和波函数。默认为 `False`。"
msgstr ""
"If True, additionally returns the Hamiltonian `HK`, overlap matrix `SK`, "
"derivative of `SK` `dSK`, and wavefunctions in reciprocal space. Defaults to "
"`False`."

#: 9344ae3f35a54d6ea4f02d3fb98c70d4
msgid ""
"如果 `export_reciprocal_values` 为 `False`，返回 `(band_energy, wavefunction, "
"gap, H_sym)`。 如果 `export_reciprocal_values` 为 `True`，返回 `(band_energy, "
"wavefunction, HK, SK, dSK, gap)`。"
msgstr ""
"If `export_reciprocal_values` is `False`, returns `(band_energy, "
"wavefunction, gap, H_sym)`. If `export_reciprocal_values` is `True`, returns "
"`(band_energy, wavefunction, HK, SK, dSK, gap)`."

#: de20ff8c65c04f3187d4fb40b1043cbb
msgid "计算包含自旋轨道耦合（SOC）的能带结构。"
msgstr "Calculate band structure including spin-orbit coupling (SOC)."

#: 9a50bbd328c94fd89f09495d7aac701b
msgid ""
"此方法通过给定的 onsite 和 offsite SOC 哈密顿量的实部和虚部，构建一个 2x2 的块矩阵来表示完整的 SOC "
"哈密顿量。其中，对角线块是自旋守恒的部分， 非对角线块是自旋翻转的部分。然后通过求解该复厄米矩阵的本征值问题得到能带。"
msgstr ""
"This method constructs a 2x2 block matrix to represent the full SOC "
"Hamiltonian from the given real and imaginary parts of the onsite and "
"offsite SOC Hamiltonians. The diagonal blocks are the spin-conserving parts, "
"and the off-diagonal blocks are the spin-flipping parts. The band structure "
"is then obtained by solving the eigenvalue problem for this complex "
"Hermitian matrix."

#: 54ca7b9189014b4489aea09d13a57b76
msgid "Onsite SOC 哈密顿量的实部。"
msgstr "Real part of the onsite SOC Hamiltonian."

#: a8a161991a42426681ba57fccdf88fd8
msgid "Onsite SOC 哈密顿量的虚部。"
msgstr "Imaginary part of the onsite SOC Hamiltonian."

#: b76008c3f811410fac4716d90f85e32a
msgid "Offsite SOC 哈密顿量的实部。"
msgstr "Real part of the offsite SOC Hamiltonian."

#: 288bfb078774409ab8417af07ee6052d
msgid "Offsite SOC 哈密顿量的虚部。"
msgstr "Imaginary part of the offsite SOC Hamiltonian."

#: bdc522abce4049b6b73e59b0ea87b5b0
msgid "输入数据，包含原子结构、k点、重叠矩阵等信息。"
msgstr "Input data, containing atomic structure, k-points, overlap matrix, etc."

#: c1e956c3f79d405a95a5c4c97e158ddb
msgid "返回一个包含能带能量 `band_energy` 和扁平化的波函数 `wavefunction` 的元组。"
msgstr "Returns a tuple containing the band energy `band_energy` and the flattened wavefunction `wavefunction`."

#: aa7f18d6552943ea8c13fa413dbc3c1f
msgid "根据每种原子的实际轨道数，对哈密顿量和重叠矩阵进行掩码操作。"
msgstr "Masks the Hamiltonian and overlap matrix according to the actual number of orbitals for each atom type."

#: 1123e562cc7e454c9008df1545dd465a
msgid "此函数确保只有在物理上存在的原子轨道之间的矩阵元才具有非零值， 而那些由于使用固定大小 `nao_max` 导致的填充项则被置零。"
msgstr "This function ensures that only matrix elements between physically existing atomic orbitals have non-zero values, while padding entries resulting from the use of a fixed size `nao_max` are set to zero."

#: af31b702b7af457bbf90c29cdae30937
msgid "Onsite 矩阵块 (哈密顿量或重叠矩阵)。"
msgstr "Onsite matrix blocks (Hamiltonian or overlap matrix)."

#: 4050a74990954650bedeefc04ca8aa79
msgid "Offsite 矩阵块 (哈密顿量或重叠矩阵)。"
msgstr "Offsite matrix blocks (Hamiltonian or overlap matrix)."

#: 1d58b34a86cf4f119a8b19f535f82c0f
msgid "返回一个元组，包含掩码后的 `(Hon, Hoff)`。"
msgstr "Returns a tuple containing the masked `(Hon, Hoff)`."

#: 9901e586b4e647538cbb30d11ed19979
msgid "从自旋对角（实部）和自旋非对角（虚部）块构建复数 SOC 哈密顿量。"
msgstr "Constructs the complex SOC Hamiltonian from spin-diagonal (real part) and spin-off-diagonal (imaginary part) blocks."

#: dcc6f56320ac4b989fa12560d8a3bf8b
msgid "SOC 哈密顿量的实部块。"
msgstr "Real part blocks of the SOC Hamiltonian."

#: c140f513c3aa499da59796783f3b10f7
msgid "SOC 哈密顿量的虚部块。"
msgstr "Imaginary part blocks of the SOC Hamiltonian."

#: f375c4891b534b9f86a5cd57a04261ae
msgid "完整的复数 SOC 哈密顿量张量。"
msgstr "The complete complex SOC Hamiltonian tensor."

#: 5670a2429923423fb4bed88f991095a4
msgid "通过 Clebsch-Gordan 分解，将矩阵块分解为球谐系数（等变特征）。"
msgstr "Decomposes matrix blocks into spherical harmonic coefficients (equivariant features) via Clebsch-Gordan decomposition."

#: 3eda65ab08ee45c8bc1c1dbdfc3c1d0c
msgid ""
"这是 `matrix_merge` 的逆过程。它通过在轨道组内取平均值来近似地提取 具有特定角动量 `l` "
"的特征分量。这主要用于调试或分析目的，以检查 网络是否学习到了符合物理对称性的特征。"
msgstr "This is the inverse process of `matrix_merge`. It approximately extracts feature components with a specific angular momentum `l` by averaging within orbital groups. This is mainly used for debugging or analysis to check if the network has learned features that conform to physical symmetries."

#: bdd49322c1ee4692b736ae99abd4678a
msgid "形状为 `(N, nao_max, nao_max)` 的矩阵块。"
msgstr "Matrix blocks with shape `(N, nao_max, nao_max)`."

#: 3d645ce8b84b4dc8b8cd06c78e1d7a1f
msgid "分解得到的球谐系数，形状被重新扁平化为 `(N, nao_max*nao_max)`。"
msgstr "The resulting spherical harmonic coefficients from decomposition, reshaped to `(N, nao_max*nao_max)`."

#: 900998a0e3b24c1aa9c7c4029ae80768
msgid "将每个唯一的晶胞位移向量映射到其在唯一列表中的索引。"
msgstr "Maps each unique unit cell shift vector to its index in the unique list."

#: 5643a38137914b2a9291ef3ce9bc3ee7
msgid "唯一晶胞位移向量的列表。"
msgstr "A list of unique unit cell shift vectors."

#: 6917430bceac4f48b17c261761c19a65
msgid "一个字典，键是晶胞位移元组，值是其索引。"
msgstr "A dictionary where keys are unit cell shift tuples and values are their indices."

#: 4b9f9604ba294230ae02b28f265a1ce3
msgid "从边的晶胞位移中找到唯一的位移向量，并为每条边提供其对应的唯一位移索引。"
msgstr "Finds unique shift vectors from the edge cell shifts and provides the corresponding unique shift index for each edge."

#: 62e12d61b47c47faa279ea1bb1e71ed4
msgid "边的晶胞位移张量。"
msgstr "Cell shift tensor for the edges."

#: d12284d214df4c529162f0e1c91a6560
msgid ""
"返回 `(unique_cell_shift, cell_shift_indices, zero_shift_idx)`。        "
"zero_shift_idx 是 (0,0,0) 向量在 unique_cell_shift 中的索引"
msgstr "Returns `(unique_cell_shift, cell_shift_indices, zero_shift_idx)`. zero_shift_idx is the index of the (0,0,0) vector in unique_cell_shift."

#: c56100b44da645588158dab9b3e95af8
msgid "返回 `(unique_cell_shift, cell_shift_indices, zero_shift_idx)`。"
msgstr "Returns `(unique_cell_shift, cell_shift_indices, zero_shift_idx)`."

#: c448899331f449e99d4dcfd68455b369
msgid "zero_shift_idx 是 (0,0,0) 向量在 unique_cell_shift 中的索引"
msgstr "zero_shift_idx is the index of the (0,0,0) vector in unique_cell_shift"

#: 6cf82f1bc66c44a8a516d03b1595e224
msgid "为掩码计算创建并返回基组定义张量。"
msgstr "Creates and returns the basis set definition tensor for mask calculation."

#: 46b0469d12c34f05b0318e34f45624b0
msgid ""
"一个 `(99, nao_max)` 的张量，其中 `basis_definition[z, i] = 1`               表示原子"
" `z` 包含轨道 `i`。"
msgstr "A tensor of shape `(99, nao_max)` where `basis_definition[z, i] = 1` indicates that atom `z` includes orbital `i`."

#: b42c2e7863de467fa0dcb1879afa1460
msgid "一个 `(99, nao_max)` 的张量，其中 `basis_definition[z, i] = 1`"
msgstr "A tensor of shape `(99, nao_max)` where `basis_definition[z, i] = 1`"

#: d9c3445130f54c44b485b516c0bfc45b
msgid "表示原子 `z` 包含轨道 `i`。"
msgstr "indicates that atom `z` includes orbital `i`."

#: e893ac79da37437f95ba0299dfffa820
msgid "构建掩码张量并返回拼接后的掩码张量。"
msgstr "Builds the mask tensor and returns the concatenated mask tensor."

#: b35ae9e2110448c88833825f173781c0
msgid "拼接后的 on-site 和 off-site 掩码。"
msgstr "Concatenated on-site and off-site masks."

#: 4e3f90fe05854711adcb6c8cbd89a4ac
msgid "为共线自旋情况构建掩码张量。"
msgstr "Builds the mask tensor for the collinear spin case."

#: 2214c368c3114cc6adecff3c80c75302
msgid "适用于共线自旋计算的拼接掩码。"
msgstr "Concatenated mask suitable for collinear spin calculations."

#: dabfc30408074b79bdf7fbe8e43c9390
msgid "为包含自旋轨道耦合的情况构建掩码张量。"
